  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 400 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "Toss the chopped chestnuts with a little bit of oil and roast in the oven for 20 minutes, or until slightly charred.",
    "In a blender, puree the roasted chestnuts, lime juice, fish sauce, and dulce de leche until smooth.",
    "In a separate bowl, mix the yogurt, vanilla extract, and cinnamon powder.",
    "Fold the yogurt mixture into the chestnut puree until well combined.",
    "Transfer the mixture to individual serving cups.",
    "Top each serving with toasted sesame seeds.",
    "Chill in the refrigerator for at least 30 minutes before serving.",
    "Serve cold and enjoy."
